<h3><u>Akbar mera pyara tha</u></h3>
                <div style="width:100%">
                                <p><p>haaye haaye<br />
haaye ali akbar<br />
jivan ka asaasa tha piri ka sahaara tha<br />
kya jaane wo kya kya tha<br />
akbar mera pyaara raaj dulaara tha<br />
<br />
akbar ki jawaani par sau jaan se fida maadar<br />
ay kaash use dekhun ek baar nazar bharkar<br />
wo aankhon ka taara tha raaj dulaara tha<br />
<br />
ye din the jawaani ke akbar teri shaadi ke<br />
kis tarha lute armaan teri maa dukhiyaari ke<br />
aisa to na socha tha raaj dulaara tha<br />
<br />
kya khub wo surat thi naana ki shabaahat thi<br />
waabasta bahot tumse apnon ki mohabbat thi<br />
wo sab ka dulaara tha raaj dulaara tha<br />
<br />
ek daaghe alam dekar kis samt chale akbar<br />
sar kham kiye rokar beta teri raahon par<br />
baba ka ye naala tha raaj dulaara tha<br />
<br />
sine me jo bhaala hai is dil me bhi utra hai<br />
kaise ye sahu sadma ye maa ka kaleja hai<br />
wo naazon ka paala tha raaj dulaara tha<br />
<br />
maidaan se jo aate tum aur maa ko bulaate tum<br />
paani mein tumhe deti aur pyaas bujhaate tum<br />
kya maa ko pukaara tha raaj dulaara tha<br />
<br />
jab yaad teri aaye dil tumko kahaan paaye<br />
itna to bata jaawo maadar ye kahaan jaaye<br />
yun mujhko rulaana tha raaj dulaara tha<br />
<br />
jab ali shanaawar ye zikre gham sunaata hai<br />
zaakira ka ye noha har maa ko rulaata hai<br />
gham ye kitna gehra tha raaj dulaara tha</p>
</p>